\item[S2] C. F. Colle, On Periodic Decompositions, One-sided Nonexpansive Directions and the Nivat Conjecture (2022), Section 1.1, periodicity and pattern complexity; Conjecture 1.3, pp.1--2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1909.08195}.
